By building this project, you will master:

✅ Full-stack development (React + FastAPI + SQL)

✅ LLM integration & prompt engineering (Gemini)

✅ Hybrid AI systems (deterministic + probabilistic)

✅ Knowledge Graph modeling with NetworkX

✅ Document parsing pipelines

✅ REST API design with Pydantic validation

✅ Modern UI/UX with Tailwind + shadcn

✅ Explainable AI design principles

