🧠 How It Works
1. Policy Ingestion Pipeline
text
Upload → Parse (PDF/DOCX) → Clean → Chunk → Store in DB → Extract Rules (Gemini) → Build Graph
2. Policy Q&A Flow
text
Question → Semantic Retrieval → Top-K Chunks → Gemini Prompt → Answer + Citations
3. Violation Detection Flow
text
Action → Rule Engine (deterministic) → Gemini (semantic) → Fusion → Verdict + Severity + Explanation
4. Knowledge Graph Reasoning
text
Nodes: Policies | Rules | Departments | Roles | Employees | Actions | Penalties
Edges: governs | applies_to | reports_to | violates | related_to | overrides
