markdown
# 🧠 Enterprise AI Policy Reasoning Engine

> An AI-powered engine that interprets enterprise policies, regulations, and governance rules, answers policy questions, and automatically detects rule violations using **Knowledge Graphs**, **Rule Engine**, and **LLM (Google Gemini)**.

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=python)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.109-009688?style=for-the-badge&logo=fastapi)
![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-18-61DAFB?style=for-the-badge&logo=react)
![TailwindCSS](https://img.shields.io/badge/TailwindCSS-3.4-38B2AC?style=for-the-badge&logo=tailwind-css)
![Gemini](https://img.shields.io/badge/Google-Gemini_API-4285F4?style=for-the-badge&logo=google)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green?style=for-the-badge)

