|---|---------|-------------|
| 1 | 📚 **Policy Ingestion** | Upload PDF/DOCX/TXT policies, auto-extract text |
| 2 | 💬 **Policy Q&A** | Ask questions in plain English, get cited answers |
| 3 | 🚨 **Violation Detection** | Describe an action, get violation verdict + severity |
| 4 | 🕸️ **Knowledge Graph** | Interactive graph of policies, rules, departments |
| 5 | 🧩 **Hybrid Reasoning** | Rule Engine + LLM fusion for accuracy |
| 6 | 📊 **Analytics Dashboard** | KPIs, charts, trends, violations heatmap |
| 7 | 🧾 **Audit Trail** | Every query & verdict is logged |
| 8 | 🎨 **Modern UI** | Dark theme, responsive, animated (Framer Motion) |
| 9 | 🔍 **Explainability** | Shows which rule/policy triggered the verdict |
| 10 | ⚡ **REST API** | Swagger docs at `/docs` |

---

## 🧰 Tech Stack

### Backend
- **Python 3.10+**
- **FastAPI** — High-performance web framework
- **SQLAlchemy 2.0** — ORM
- **SQLite** — Zero-config database (MySQL-ready)
- **Pydantic v2** — Data validation
- **Google Gemini API** (`gemini-1.5-flash`) — LLM
- **NetworkX** — Knowledge graph
- **PyPDF2 / python-docx** — Document parsing
- **Uvicorn** — ASGI server

### Frontend
- **React 18** + **Vite**
- **TailwindCSS** + **shadcn/ui**
- **React Router DOM v6**
- **Axios** — HTTP client
- **React Flow** — Graph visualization
- **Recharts** — Charts
- **Framer Motion** — Animations
- **Lucide React** — Icons
- **React Hot Toast** — Notifications

### Database
- **SQLite** (default) — Tables: `users`, `policies`, `rules`, `violations`, `queries`, `entities`, `relationships`, `audit_logs`

