## 📝 Ab Kya Karna Hai

1. Ye pura content copy kar
2. Apne project folder mein jaa: `C:\Users\HP\enterprise-policy-reasoning-engine\`
3. `README.md` file kholo (Notepad ya VS Code se)
4. Pura purana content delete kar
5. Ye naya content paste kar
6. Save kar (Ctrl + S)

Fir terminal mein:

```powershell
git add README.md
git commit -m "Update README with full project documentation"
git push
🎯 Uske Baad
Push hone ke baad mujhe bata. Main backend ka actual code dena start karta hoon — file-by-file:

main.py

config.py

Models

Schemas

Services (Gemini, Rule Engine, Knowledge Graph)

Routes

Ya frontend pehle chahiye toh bata. 🚀

